**Outreach size prior (2026-09-18, from PIN × Population):** prioritize
hromadas of **10–40 thousand** (~631 / 1432 with `Population`; mixed
міська / селищна / сільська). Enough capacity to sign Law 1508, still
need partners (DOBRE bottleneck), matches ВА ОТГ not АМУ. Second wave:
**5–10k сільські** in Poltava / Rivne / Vinnytsia / Dnipro (already sign
bilateral МСС). Deprioritize **100k+** for the 1508 product (twinning /
donor track). Skip **<5k** unless explicit-ask or already in a named
cluster. Rayon centres 40–100k: optional operational МСС, not first outreach.
Median hromada ~11k; селищні 10–20k are an underserved gap.
**First practical list** (narrower than the whole 10–40k band):
міські + селищні **15–35k** in oblasts with an МСС signing habit; сільські
**8–15k** with explicit-ask or a live PIN tie — but **not** members of one
tourism/waste mega-clique (Dnister canyon, Zakarpattia ТПВ, Hutsul) as cold
leads. PIN degree ≥10 is almost always one multi-party clique — rank by
distinct agreements, not unique partners. Canvas:
`canvases/hromada-size-stats.canvas.tsx` / `connected-hromadas.canvas.tsx`.
